error[E0129]: Post has attributes, which Vuka writes into its Schema method, and declares Schema itself; move them into the method: s.Field(&p.X, …)
  --> err_schema.vuka:15:16
   |
15 | func (p *Post) Schema(s *orm.Schema) {}
   |                ^^^^^^
   |
   = help: write the attributes in the method, or drop the method and keep the attributes

error[E0130]: @ui.Loads is a hook; write its arguments in parentheses: @ui.Loads(…)
  --> err_schema.vuka:22:1
   |
22 | @ui.Loads{Group: "rows"}
   | ^^^^^^^^^
   |
   = help: write a hook bare or with its arguments in parentheses: @ui.Mount, @ui.Loads("lists")

Some errors have detailed explanations: E0129, E0130.
For more information about an error, try `vuka explain E0129`.
